<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="row" id="problem">
      <h2 class="row-title">The problem</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p class="lead">The people who most need your message are not looking for it. A song, a film or a book is something they choose to watch, and it carries the message with it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" id="what">
      <h2 class="row-title">What we do</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <ul class="terms">
          <li><strong>Creative direction.</strong> We lead the creative direction of your production, working with your team and respecting your budget.</li>
          <li><strong>Narrative and concept.</strong> The story, the imaginaries and the world the work lives in, built around the themes you want to bring together.</li>
          <li><strong>References and world-building.</strong> We work from the references you already have, and bring the ones you do not.</li>
          <li><strong>Songwriting.</strong> Original songs written to your topic, in English or Portuguese.</li>
          <li><strong>Production, when you need it.</strong> Delivered through our curated and approved partners, across music, screen, photography and publishing.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" id="how">
      <h2 class="row-title">How it works</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>You send the topic, the audience and the goal.</li>
          <li>We propose the concept, the references and the narrative.</li>
          <li>We lead the creative direction, working alongside your production team.</li>
          <li>You own the finished work. If you need the production made as well, our curated and approved partners deliver it.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" id="why-us">
      <h2 class="row-title">Why us</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p>A creative innovation studio led by Dr WELI, an <strong>award-winning creative director</strong>, evolutionary ecologist (PhD, ANU) and recording artist, originator of sci pop. He directed <em>Kangaroo Time</em>, the AAAS <em>Dance Your PhD</em> Overall Winner 2024, and the credits for it are further down this page. <strong>What he brings is a creative director who weaves scientific thinking into the making</strong>, alongside aesthetics and themes drawn from science and science fiction, and multicultural and other cultural references, chosen to suit what you are trying to say. We work on complex or technical topics: science, health, sustainability, inclusion and culture.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" id="who-for">
      <h2 class="row-title">Who it is for</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p>Communications and marketing leads, culture and belonging teams, university engagement and research-impact teams, museums and science centres, campaign and community leads including government CALD campaigns, NGOs and public-sector programs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" id="pricing">
      <h2 class="row-title">What it costs</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p>Commissions are quoted to your brief, and we work to your budget rather than a fixed menu. What moves the number is the scope of the direction, how long we are on it, and whether you want us to make the work as well or only to lead it. Send the topic, the audience and your budget; we reply within two working days. Our past work is below.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@wildwoohoo.com?subject=Commission%20a%20work">Bring us your topic</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

